{"id":269098,"name":"Downtown 14B, 1BDR","headline":"The Brass Lantern Studio @ Downtown Cairo","summary":"Welcome to our studio where Historic Charm Meets Modern Living, our boutique studios offer a peaceful urban sanctuary amidst the city’s electric energy. Step outside to discover stunning Belle Époque architecture, historic cafes, and hidden art galleries—all just minutes from your doorstep.","description":{"Space":"\n\r\nThis bright and cozy studio is designed for relaxation and comfort  the perfect retreat after a day spent exploring the historic city of Cairo.\r\nInside, you’ll find:\r\n\r\n✔️ One queen-sized bed with hotel-quality Egyptian cotton linens\r\n✔️ A bathroom stocked with fresh face and body towels\r\n✔️ A compact kitchenette for light meal preparation\r\n✔️  Free Wi-Fi, and a 55 inch smart TV for further personal entertainment. \r\n✔️ A Nespresso machine\r\n✔️ Complimentary bottled water and two coffee capsules\r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\n✔️Guests will have full private access to the Apartment and all of its amenities during their stay.\r\n✔️For larger groups or multiple bookings, feel free to contact us — we may have additional units available in the same building or nearby.\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\n✔️We’re available to assist you between 9:00 AM and 4:00 AM Cairo time.\r\n✔️Whether you have questions before arrival or need help during your stay, our team is happy to support you on via Airbnb messages throughout your experience.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\n\r\n✔️ Safety & Accessibility\r\n  the location provides unbeatable access to Tahrir Square and Egyptian Museum.\r\n✔️ Authentic Local Surroundings\r\n-5 minute walk to Cairo Downtown.\r\n- Cairo International Airport is a 35 minute drive.\r\n- Giza Pyramids is a 35 minute drive.\r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\n✔️ Location: Just a short walk to the Tahrir square and Egyptian Museum — perfect for sightseeing.\r\n✔️ Transportation: Uber, In-drive, and local taxis are easily available 24/7.\r\n✔️ Private Services:\r\nWe offer convenient airport pickup, drop-off, and private guided tours across Cairo and Giza. Just message us to arrange in advance.\r\n⚠️ Parking is not provided. Guests may use nearby street or private parking (subject to availability).\r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\n✔️Smoking is only allowed in the balcony or outside the building (a fine of $100 will be imposed when smoking indoors) \r\n✔️Visitors are not allowed, only confirmed guests will be granted entry. \r\n✔️We kindly ask that you treat the space with care and leave it tidy at check-out.\r\n✔️Downtown Cairo is a historic, bustling hub that truly never sleeps. Because of its central location and lively energy, the area can be quite noisy throughout the day and late into the night. You will likely hear street music, bustling crowds, and Cairo's famous symphony of car horns."},"city":"Cairo","capacity_of_guests":2,"number_of_bedrooms":1,"number_of_beds":2,"number_of_bathrooms":1,"number_of_stars":null,"location_address1":"15 Al Bustan St, Bab Al Louq, Abdeen, Cairo Governorate 4280120","location_address2":"","location_lat":"30.0453979","location_lng":"31.2378931","booking_link":null,"airbnb_link":null,"rental_type":"studio","featured":false,"cleaning_fee":15,"checkin_time":15,"checkout_time":11,"booking_sync_cleaning_fee_id":520523,"active":1,"can_book":1,"agreement":"Kindly note that a damage deposit of USD 100 (or the equivalent in EGP) is required. The payment is collected online as part of the reservation payment and will be reimbursed on the checkout day, provided no damages are incurred.\r\n  • Smoking (including shisha) inside the unit is strictly not allowed. However it is allowed in the unit’s balcony (if applicable). A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors.\r\n • Partying, excessive noise and public alcohol drinking is not allowed. In case of violations, security will be notified and appropriate strict actions will be taken. \r\n • Visitors are not allowed, only c